{"id":"n15180-1-8","stage":1,"title":"떡볶이 · 辣炒年糕","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15180-1-8-1","ko":"아줌마, 떡볶이랑 튀김이랑 모두 얼마예요?","zh":"阿姨，炒年糕和炸物的总价是多少？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아줌마,","meaning":"阿姨，大妈","explanation":"아줌마：阿姨，大妈","readings":[{"term":"아줌마","audio":"/audio/e5b180921be3db40e82e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72485","senseId":"1","lemma":"아줌마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떡볶이랑","meaning":"辣炒年糕","explanation":"떡볶이：辣炒年糕；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"떡볶이","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15180","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡볶이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"튀김이랑","meaning":"油炸食品","explanation":"튀김：油炸食品；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"튀김","audio":"/audio/a0b9e6d18fa4c97ed0ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82383","senseId":"1","lemma":"튀김","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모두","meaning":"一共","explanation":"모두：一共","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"2","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마예요?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e5b180921be3db40","term":"아줌마","zh":"阿姨，大妈","audio":"/audio/e5b180921be3db40e82e.mp3","entryId":"72485","definition":"(谦词)陌生人之间用于指称或称呼已婚女子。","pronunciation":["아줌마"]},{"id":"694b11f55ee86234","term":"떡볶이","zh":"辣炒年糕","audio":"/audio/694b11f55ee8623449d2.mp3","entryId":"15180","definition":"将长条年糕切成适当大小，加入酱油或辣椒酱等调料和各种蔬菜一同炒熟的食物。","pronunciation":["떡뽀끼"]},{"id":"a0b9e6d18fa4c97e","term":"튀김","zh":"油炸食品","audio":"/audio/a0b9e6d18fa4c97ed0ba.mp3","entryId":"82383","definition":"在鱼、肉或蔬菜里粘上面粉而油炸的食物。","pronunciation":["튀김"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"一共","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"28135","definition":"全都加在一起。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/b4c39c88cda2f454efec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15180-1-8-2","ko":"전부 합해서 오천 원이란다.","zh":"加起来一共是五千韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전부","meaning":"全部","explanation":"전부：全部","readings":[{"term":"전부","audio":"/audio/47f5c6ba3e704438d2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19468","senseId":"1","lemma":"전부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합해서","meaning":"求和，相加","explanation":"합하다：求和，相加；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"합하다","audio":"/audio/608392e8b950bce17031.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85534","senseId":"3","lemma":"합하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오천","meaning":"5000（汉字数词）","explanation":"오천：5000（汉字数词）","readings":[{"term":"오천","audio":"/audio/db8fc547a104d0568f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"원이란다.","meaning":"韩元，韩币；表示引用。","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币；하다：表示引用。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"47f5c6ba3e704438","term":"전부","zh":"全部","audio":"/audio/47f5c6ba3e704438d2c3.mp3","entryId":"19468","definition":"把各部分全都合起来的整体。","pronunciation":["전부"]},{"id":"608392e8b950bce1","term":"합하다","zh":"求和，相加","audio":"/audio/608392e8b950bce17031.mp3","entryId":"85534","definition":"两个及以上的数或算式相加。","pronunciation":["하파다"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"韩元，韩币","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3","entryId":"27771","definition":"韩国货币单位。","pronunciation":["원"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef1908429a52a5626faa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.898,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15180","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.4956,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["加起来一共是五千韩元。","阿姨，炒年糕和炸物的总价是多少？","您完成工作的速度比预想的还要快啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["阿姨，炒年糕和炸物的总价是多少？","您完成工作的速度比预想的还要快啊。","加起来一共是五千韩元。"],"answer":2}]}
